windvale-assembly 1

# Windows x64 staged-WVO publisher. Portable Windvale code admits the exact
# input/manifest/chunk sequence; this adapter independently validates and
# rereads those immutable snapshots, rejects destination aliases, and delegates
# the admitted sequence to the shared handle-relative durable transaction.
